  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Cloud bread floats onto your plate like a soft little pillow, perfect for topping with avocado mash or a swipe of berry jam. Made with whipped egg whites, creamy goat cheese, a splash of apple cider vinegar, and a pinch of cream of tartar, it bakes up golden, light, and airy. Each bite feels cloud soft yet sturdy enough for mini sandwiches or sweet brunch treats. Naturally gluten free and grain free, it’s an easy, low fuss way to add a bit of magic to your routine.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-cloud-bread\">Why You’ll Love This Cloud Bread</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-cloud-bread\">How to Make Cloud Bread</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-cloud-bread\">Pro Tips for Making Cloud Bread</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-cloud-bread\">How to Serve this Cloud Bread</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-cloud-bread\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This Cloud Bread</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Light and airy texture that feels like a dream.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfect for low-carb and keto lifestyles.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Gluten-free, making it a great option for everyone.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick and easy to whip up in no time.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Versatile for sandwiches, snacks, or even desserts!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-11572\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"11572\" data-servings=\"6\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wprm-padding-40 meadow-header\">\n  <div class=\"wp